🔄 FULL SYSTEM FLOW
Input arrives
Perception builds structured query
Memory retrieves context (RAG)
Emma routes to relevant Little Lucys
Little Lucys generate candidate reasoning
Emma evaluates + merges
Safety filters
Lucy Prime synthesizes final response
Output layer delivers
Memory updated



